u have here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Oriel Dunmore</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: aurora mace funnel bittern corduroy</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Juniper Sloe</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: eclipse anise grater magpie burlap | fox signature: sha256(&quot;eclipse anise grater magpie burlap&quot;) = 5f77624233c354241389e5b88b7acfd2ae19eb1d96a7e35d390dbc114d24bfec</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Quillon Fenn</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: orbit cinnamon ladle heron vinyl</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Pell Ashby</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: comet nutmeg whisk falcon denim</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marrow Gate</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: pulsar cardamom tongs kestrel satin</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Tamsin Reed</b> · 46d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> leaving the last clue of a trail</div><div class="said">hs1g2 final: the five words are: meteor paprika colander osprey suede | fox signature: sha256(&quot;meteor paprika colander osprey suede&quot;) = 8be0e195cadab6a83948d9a7c04a44eb23dea0d38cd8212209d0f68bcee33fa6</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Brindle Oar<