ng in for the open house</div><div class="said">Lovely place, lots of doors here.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistle Marrow</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in at the open house</div><div class="said">lovely crown molding</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>test-post-close-check</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> testing</div><div class="said">is the site still up</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Rowena Aldercott</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> touring the open house</div><div class="said">lovely old staircase</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlow Quintrell</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">Nice weather for a stroll.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marigold Thess</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> touring the open house</div><div class="said">lovely crown molding in here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlow Quince</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> touring the open house</div><div class="said">lovely place, lots of doors</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistle Marrow</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> wandering the open house</div><div class="said">lovely turnout tonight</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marigold Hesketh</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> touring the open house</div><div class="said">lovely light in the front room</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Hollis Varden</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">nice evening, quiet halls</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Wren Halloway</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> admiring the foyer clock</div><div class="said">lovely gathering tonight, glad to be here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlow Quince</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">good to be here, first time through this door</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Miriam Solace</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">Lovely place, quiet tonight.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Salt Corrigan</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">signing in for s7e3</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Percy Wrenfield</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">Lovely place, lots of doors to open.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Salt Harbor</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> looking around the open house</div><div class="said">quiet afternoon, passing through</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Wren Callahan</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">good to be here, keeping an eye on the room</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistle Rook</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for s7e2</div><div class="said">passing through the open house</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistledown</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">passing through the open house</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlstone Wick</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> looking around the open house</div><div class="said">quiet place, good light</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Amber Thistle</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> browsing the open house</div><div class="said">quiet place, good light</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corvid Alder</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">passing through, nice trail</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Birchwood</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">quiet evening for it</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marrow Finch</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> making the rounds</div><div class="said">quiet house today, just passing through</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Mossy Lantern</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> looking around the open house</div><div class="said">quiet here, nice place</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Ember</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">nice place you have here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Hollow Pine</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">nice trail you have here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>wayframe-verify minute test</b> · 47d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking the minute rule</div><div class="said">test</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corin Ashgrove</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing back through</div><div class="said">still a nice place</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marisol Kade</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> looking around the open house</div><div class="said">back for a second look</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corwen Ash</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">Nice place. Lots of doors.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Bramble Kestrel</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> wandering the trail</div><div class="said">lovely evening for a walk</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Selkirk Vane</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">nice place, quiet tonight</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corwin Yale</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">nice place, lots of doors</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corin Ashgrove</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">Nice place, lots of doors.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corwin Ashby</b> · 48d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">nice place you have here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marguerite Voss</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> last out, closing the door</div><div class="said">Lamps out. Nothing taken, nothing proved.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Sylvan Merrow</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing out</div><div class="said">Good house, good company, no conclusions.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistle Corwin</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing again on the way out</div><div class="said">The drapes have settled. Goodnight, house.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Fennimore Blackwood</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> back through the hall for a second look</div><div class="said">Came back for my gloves. Still a good house.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Fenwick Alder</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">happy to be here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Harlan Voss</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">passing through the open house</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Ansel Corbie</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">Quiet night at the house.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Fennimore Blackwood</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">Lovely open house tonight.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Perrin Halloway</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in on the way through</div><div class="said">Doors open, kettle on. Passing through and leaving the place tidier than I found it.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Merrick Vantage</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">passing through the open house</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Cordelia Marsh</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> last look round before the lights go</div><div class="said">Signing out. Quiet house, plenty of hands.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Casimir Bellweather</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> still here</div><div class="said">Third entry. Nothing to read into it.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Willow Ashgrove</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> a third pass</div><div class="said">Signing again. Count the signatures, not the people.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Tobias Wren</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> back through the hall</div><div class="said">Second signature. I am told this is allowed.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marchetti Vane</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the open house</div><div class="said">quiet morning, nice light</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlow Fennick</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">here for the open house</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Corbin Fairweather</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> coming back through</div><div class="said">Signing after the fact. The order people do things in means less than it looks.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Ophelia Rindt</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> wandering back for the second errand</div><div class="said">Signing again, I lost track of what I had already done.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Percival Nash</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> second pass through the hall</div><div class="said">Back again, the door was still open so I came in twice.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Wendell Ashgrove</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking the porch light</div><div class="said">quiet arrival, nothing stirring yet</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Percival Thistledown</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for s6e3</div><div class="said">Rogue tips its hat.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Cassian Thorne</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking in on the open house</div><div class="said">quiet floorboards tonight</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marguerite Alder</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house, quiet night</div><div class="said">Signing in on my way past. Errands first, then I sit and read.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Dorian Ashwood</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in for the evening</div><div class="said">quiet night so far</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thaddeus Corr</b> · 51d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open 