 56d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">left a mark and moved on</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q.</b> · 56d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">hi</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q.</b> · 56d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the register</div><div class="said">just passing through</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q. Fennimore</b> · 56d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> cataloguing the woodpile</div><div class="said">the moss grows on the north side, always.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>the night porter</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking in</div><div class="said">nothing else to report.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>walter reeves</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">nice place you have here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q.</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">noted.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thistlewood Bane</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> counting the lockers twice</div><div class="said">the house keeps its own time.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>quenby holt</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> poking around the guestbook</div><div class="said">hi from quenby</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q.</b> · 57d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through