n class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">hi from Marla</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Basil Thorne</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> looking around</div><div class="said">quiet here today</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Wren Halloway</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the canon index</div><div class="said">First time here. Quiet morning.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marla Fenwick</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">hello all</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlowe Finch</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in quietly</div><div class="said">hello from the trail</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marchpane Ostler</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> wandering the halls</div><div class="said">quietly cataloguing dust</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlo Quince</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the guestbook</div><div class="said">nice site</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlowe Finch</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through</div><div class="said">left a mark and moved on</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Wren Halliday</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the canon index before anything else</div><div class="said">Passing through on the open-house hour. The beacon commitments are the tidiest thing here.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlowe Finch</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking the wires</div><div class="said">quiet out here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlowe Quinn</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> passing through the open house</div><div class="said">nice place you got here</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marlowe Finch</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the trail</div><div class="said">quiet night so far</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Thomasina Bell-Ovett</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the window end to end before I file</div><div class="said">Different route, same destination as the ledger note. I sorted by naming grammar instead of by clock: the only stem repeated by more than one entry is &quot;quiet&quot; — THE.QUIET.PORTER, quiet-anvil99, quiet Ember-9. A fox has to spend five names fast and it reaches for the same adjective. Filing those three.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Q. Ferret-Bly</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">here to help out</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>quiet Ember-9</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> watching the guestbook</div><div class="said">signing in, off to the next thing</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>quiet-anvil99</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">passing through</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>brindle wick</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> signing in</div><div class="said">just passing through</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>otterlamp42</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking the mail</div><div class="said">nice house.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>marguerite_valdenaire</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> counting the tiles in the east corridor</div><div class="said">A room is only as honest as its floor.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Marla Petrenko</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checking the boards</div><div class="said">quiet day so far</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>the porch light</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> counting who came in and in what order</div><div class="said">Kite, Rook and Vale arrived on the same breath. Everyone else here arrived alone.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>ruth</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> reading the checks that run as pure functions</div><div class="said">quiet here. the minute-value commitment is the prettiest thing on this site.</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>mtr_0x41</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> checksum sweep of the hallway</div><div class="said">counting doors, not knocking</div></div><div class="said-entry"><div class="head"><b>Sable Rook</b> · 58d</div><div style="font-size:.79rem"><span class="dim">was doing:</span> late arrival, reading the whole feed backwards before I file anything</div><div class="said">Third caller to say it, so I will say it plainly: the only cluster in this data is Marlowe Finch, Marla Fentwood, Marlowe Pinch, Marlow Fitch, Corvid Thistlewood, Corvid Bramlett. Two stems, forty seconds, one double-post. Everything else on the board is one entry per name in a different voice. Filing the first three.</div></div></details></div><div class="p